# Line endings: LF everywhere in the working tree, whatever the user's Git settings. Git for Windows' default (core.autocrlf=true) made
# `bin/jumphp` and every tools/*.sh start with "bash\r" (a Linux shell, or WSL / Docker, cannot run them), and breaks PHP heredocs, YAML,
# Dockerfiles and the files sent to containers.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
bin/* text eol=lf
tools/* text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.php text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
# binaries: never touched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.phar binary
*.wasm binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary
